         <description>
            <p>
               Astro Bucket List 0.47.0 and Subframe Quality Review 0.55.3 have been re-signed for PixInsight 1.9.6 build 1719. The new signatures allow PixInsight to verify both scripts against its updated libraries. The Astro Bucket List installation guide and README now specify PixInsight 1.9.6 build 1719 or later.
